  "notes": "FINANCIAL USAGE:\n{元本|がんぽん} refers to the original amount of money, separate from gains or interest.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {元本|がんぽん}{保証|ほしょう} (principal guarantee)\n- {元本|がんぽん}{割|わ}れ (loss of principal)\n- {元本|がんぽん}を{取|と}り{戻|もど}す (to recover principal)\n- {元本|がんぽん}を{確保|かくほ}する (to secure principal)\n\nRELATED FINANCIAL TERMS:\n- {利息|りそく} (interest)\n- {利回|りまわ}り (yield)\n- {元金|がんきん} (principal - synonym)\n- {額面|がくめん} (face value)",
